{"id": "71628", "title": "阴缘了了", "author": "浮笙冷", "category": "都市言情", "count": 42, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/71/71628.htm", "intro": "我清明节上坟，不小心招惹了一只难缠的厉鬼！！！\n    他威逼恐吓，引我到偏僻的小镇，在这里诡异无处不在，鬼怪四处潜伏，我经历了人生一场又一场的噩梦！\n    梦魇初醒，却被最亲的人卖去配阴亲！棺材里，有个冷厉的声音在我耳边说：“女人，躲得过初一躲不过十五，既做了我的妻，我一定好好疼你……”\n    后来——\n    “你心里既然只有她，为什么还要纠缠我？”我撕心裂肺的大吼。\n    “因为她。”他轻启薄唇，说的云淡风轻。\n    【更新时间：早上七点和十点，多谢亲们支持，么么哒O(&amp;cap;_&amp;cap;)O~】", "base": "files/article/html/71/71628", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "001 带回一只鬼", "file": "11228318.html", "available": false}, {"title": "002 恶鬼缠身", "file": "11228319.html", "available": false}, {"title": "003 害死了无辜人", "file": "11228320.html", "available": false}, {"title": "004 东华镇", "file": "11228321.html", "available": false}, {"title": "005 神秘男人", "file": "11228322.html", "available": false}, {"title": "006 单挑厉鬼？", "file": "11228323.html", "available": false}, {"title": "007 厕所遇鬼", "file": "11228324.html", "available": false}, {"title": "008 恶鬼来了", "file": "11228325.html", "available": false}, {"title": "009 冥币上的地址", "file": "11228326.html", "available": false}, {"title": "010 寻找宋舒怡", "file": "11228327.html", "available": false}, {"title": "011 灵安路19号", "file": "11228328.html", "available": false}, {"title": "012 小镇秘密", "file": "11228329.html", "available": false}, {"title": "013 没有姓秦的人家", "file": "11228330.html", "available": false}, {"title": "014 阴媒婆婆来了", "file": "11228331.html", "available": false}, {"title": "015 献祭山鬼", "file": "11228332.html", "available": false}, {"title": "016 将死之人", "file": "11228333.html", "available": false}, {"title": "017 老井尸水", "file": "11228334.html", "available": false}, {"title": "018 胭脂咒", "file": "11228335.html", "available": false}, {"title": "019 厉鬼新的指示", "file": "11228336.html", "available": false}, {"title": "020 睡在风里的少年", "file": "11228337.html", "available": false}, {"title": "021 山鬼？", "file": "11228338.html", "available": false}, {"title": "